          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "13.4 Median of Grouped Data"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.096,
            0.165,
            0.902,
            0.334
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "As you have studied in Class IX, the median is a measure of central tendency which gives the value of the middle-most observation in the data. Recall that for finding the median of ungrouped data, we first arrange the data values of the observations in ascending order. Then, if n is odd, the median is the "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\left( { \\frac { n + 1 } { 2 } } \\right)"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " th observation. And, if n is even, then the median will be the average of the "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\frac { n } { 2 }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " thand the "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\left( { \\frac { n } { 2 } } + 1 \\right)"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " th observations."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.097,
            0.351,
            0.9,
            0.389
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Suppose, we have to find the median of the following data, which gives the marks, out of 50, obtained by 100 students in a test :"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.125,
            0.396,
            0.862,
            0.481
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "table_body",
              "index": 5,
              "bbox": [
                0.125,
                0.396,
                0.862,
                0.481
              ],
              "image_path": "images/page_17_table_5.jpg",
              "content": "<table><tbody><tr><td>Marks obtained</td><td>20</td><td>29</td><td>28</td><td>33</td><td>42</td><td>38</td><td>43</td><td>25</td></tr><tr><td>Number of students</td><td>6</td><td>28</td><td>24</td><td>15</td><td>2</td><td>4</td><td>1</td><td>20</td></tr></tbody></table>"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
